			"Message": "style(Vine): Normalize table column alignment and line wrapping in documentation\n\nRe-align the Shim Compatibility tables in both README.md and Architecture.md with consistent pipe alignment and dash-width separators matching the project's formatting conventions for markdown tables. Re-wrap prose paragraphs in both files to a consistent hard-wrap column width.\n\nNo behavioral changes — documentation formatting only.",
