				2
			],
			"Message": "docs(Vine): Add Shim Compatibility section to Architecture and README\n\nDocument the deep-shim interception system support in the Vine element — the 🟠 Low-Level Shim (TierShim=Own|Preempt) for JavaScript prototype-level hooks and the 🔵 Coverage Shim (TierShim=Proxy|Replace) for application service routing and audit.\n\nBoth new sections explain the tier gating behind the `TierShim` env var (default: None, zero overhead) and clarify that no shim-specific modules exist in Vine — events are routed through Wind/Mountain/Cocoon.\n\nNo behavioral changes — documentation only.",
